<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>스마트 교실 좌석 배치표</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pretendard:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
    }
    @media print {
      @page {
        size: A4 landscape;
        margin: 4mm 6mm;
      }
      *, *::before, *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box !important;
      }
      html, body {
        height: 100% !important;
        max-height: 100% !important;
        overflow: hidden !important;
        background: #fff !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
        margin: 0 !important;
      }
      .no-print {
        display: none !important;
      }
      .print-area {
        box-shadow: none !important;
        border: none !important;
        width: 100% !important;
        max-width: 100% !important;
        height: 98vh !important;
        max-height: 98vh !important;
        padding: 1mm 2mm !important;
        margin: 0 auto !important;
        display: flex !important;
        flex-direction: column !important;
        justify-content: flex-start !important;
        align-items: center !important;
        gap: 3px !important;
        page-break-inside: avoid !important;
        break-inside: avoid !important;
        overflow: hidden !important;
        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important;
        print-color-adjust: exact !important;
      }
      #class-title-input {
        border: none !important;
        background: transparent !important;
        font-size: 22px !important;
        font-weight: 900 !important;
        text-align: center !important;
        width: 100% !important;
        box-shadow: none !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
        margin-bottom: 0px !important;
      }
      .creator-tag {
        font-size: 10px !important;
        color: #64748b !important;
        font-weight: 600 !important;
      }
      #front-indicator {
        margin-bottom: 4px !important;
        margin-top: 0 !important;
        padding: 0 !important;
        width: 100% !important;
      }
      #front-indicator > div {
        padding-top: 3px !important;
        padding-bottom: 3px !important;
      }
      /* Seating area flex fill */
      .print-area > .overflow-x-auto {
        flex: 1 1 0% !important;
        width: 100% !important;
        display: flex !important;
        flex-direction: column !important;
        min-height: 0 !important;
        overflow: hidden !important;
        padding-bottom: 0 !important;
      }
      #sections-container {
        flex: 1 1 0% !important;
        height: 100% !important;
        min-height: 0 !important;
        min-width: 100% !important;
        width: 100% !important;
        gap: 8px !important;
        align-items: stretch !important;
      }
      #sections-container > div {
        height: 100% !important;
        display: flex !important;
        flex-direction: column !important;
        padding: 4px 6px !important;
      }
      #sections-container > div > .grid {
        flex: 1 1 0% !important;
        height: 100% !important;
        min-height: 0 !important;
        gap: 4px !important;
      }
      .seat-card {
        border: 1.5px solid #334155 !important;
        min-height: 0 !important;
        height: 100% !important;
        padding: 2px 3px !important;
        background-color: #ffffff !important;
        display: flex !important;
        flex-direction: column !important;
        justify-content: space-between !important;
        overflow: hidden !important;
      }
      .student-id-txt {
        font-size: clamp(10px, 1.3vw, 13px) !important;
        font-weight: 800 !important;
        color: #312e81 !important;
        margin-bottom: 1px !important;
        line-height: 1.1 !important;
      }
      .student-name-txt {
        font-size: clamp(14px, 2.1vw, 21px) !important;
        font-weight: 900 !important;
        color: #000000 !important;
        letter-spacing: 0.3px !important;
        line-height: 1.1 !important;
        white-space: nowrap !important;
      }
    }
    .seat-card {
      transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }
    .seat-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    .seat-selected {
      ring-width: 3px;
      outline: 2px solid #3b82f6;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-30 shadow-sm no-print">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-md shadow-indigo-200">
          🪑
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">교실 좌석 배치표</h1>
            <span class="text-[11px] bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold border border-slate-200">만든이: 샤오린 2026</span>
          </div>
          <p id="header-layout-desc" class="text-xs text-slate-500">배치 구조: 1분단(3열×4줄) · 2분단(2열×3줄) · 3분단(3열×4줄) [총 30석]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <button id="btn-open-setup" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-lg shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>⚙️</span>
          <span>인원/분단 설정</span>
        </button>
        <button id="btn-toggle-view" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-lg shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span id="toggle-view-icon">👩‍🏫</span>
          <span id="toggle-view-text">교사용 시점</span>
        </button>
        <button id="btn-shuffle" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-lg shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>🎲</span>
          <span>랜덤 배치</span>
        </button>
        <button id="btn-reset" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>🔄</span>
          <span>초기화</span>
        </button>
        <button id="btn-open-list" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-lg shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>📝</span>
          <span>명단 일괄 입력</span>
        </button>
        <div class="relative inline-flex rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <button id="btn-print" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-l-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span>🖨️</span>
            <span>인쇄 / PDF</span>
          </button>
          <button id="btn-print-popup" title="브라우저 제한 시 새 창으로 열어 인쇄" class="px-2.5 py-2 bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-r-lg border-l border-slate-600 transition flex items-center">
            <span class="text-xs">새 창</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto p-4 sm:p-6 flex flex-col items-center">
    
    <!-- Info bar & view switch -->
    <div class="w-full max-w-5xl mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-slate-600 no-print">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">
        <span class="text-base">💡</span>
        <span>좌석을 클릭하면 이름을 바로 수정하거나, 두 좌석을 차례로 클릭해 자리를 맞바꿀 수 있습니다.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span id="view-status-badge" class="text-xs bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>👨‍🎓</span><span>학생 시점 (칠판 위)</span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold" id="seat-count-badge">배치 현황: 0 / 30명</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Classroom Canvas Board -->
    <div class="print-area bg-white w-full max-w-5xl rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col items-center">
      
      <!-- Classroom Title Banner (Directly Editable) -->
      <div class="w-full mb-1 sm:mb-1.5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative">
        <div class="w-full flex justify-end items-center px-1 mb-0.5">
          <span class="creator-tag text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium tracking-tight">만든이: 샤오린 2026</span>
        </div>
        <div class="relative group w-full max-w-xl flex items-center justify-center">
          <input 
            type="text" 
            id="class-title-input" 
            value="우리 반 좌석 배치표" 
            class="w-full text-center text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-black text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 focus:bg-white border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-indigo-300 focus:border-indigo-600 focus:outline-none transition-all py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg cursor-text tracking-tight"
            placeholder="학급 이름을 입력하세요 (예: 3학년 2반 좌석 배치표)"
            title="클릭하여 학급 이름을 직접 수정할 수 있습니다"
          />
          <span class="no-print absolute right-2 text-slate-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-xs flex items-center gap-1 pointer-events-none">
            ✏️ 클릭 수정
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Front Indicator: Only Blackboard -->
      <div id="front-indicator" class="w-full mb-2.5 sm:mb-3 flex flex-col items-center order-1">
        <!-- Blackboard -->
        <div class="w-full max-w-2xl bg-emerald-800 text-emerald-100 py-1.5 sm:py-2 px-6 rounded-lg text-center font-bold text-sm tracking-widest shadow-inner border-2 border-emerald-950 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <span>칠</span> <span>판</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Seating Rows Container: Always horizontal side-by-side view (1분단 - 2분단 - 3분단) -->
      <div class="w-full overflow-x-auto pb-2 order-2">
        <div id="sections-container" class="min-w-[640px] w-full flex flex-row justify-center items-start gap-2.5 sm:gap-4 lg:gap-5 transition-all">
          <!-- Dynamic Sections & Aisles Injected by JavaScript -->
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Initial / Layout Setup Modal -->
  <div id="modal-setup" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 border border-slate-100 flex flex-col gap-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">⚙️</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">학급 인원 및 분단 구성 설정</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">원하시는 학급 환경에 맞춰 좌석 구조를 지정하세요.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button id="btn-close-setup" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 text-xl font-bold p-1">✕</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Total students setting -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">학급 총 학생 수</label>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <input type="number" id="setup-total-students" min="1" max="50" value="30" class="w-24 px-3 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-base font-bold text-center focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:outline-none">
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">명 (1번부터 순차 할당 및 명단 반영)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Preset selector -->
      <div>
        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-2">분단 배치 형식 선택</label>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          
          <label class="preset-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50/50 cursor-pointer transition">
            <input type="radio" name="layout-preset" value="preset-3-2-3" checked class="mt-1 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-800">3분단 변형 (3 - 2 - 3)</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded">추천 / 기본</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">1분단(3×4=12석) · 2분단(2×3=6석) · 3분단(3×4=12석) [총 30석]</p>
            </div>
          </label>

          <label class="preset-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-slate-300 cursor-pointer transition">
            <input type="radio" name="layout-preset" value="preset-3-equal" class="mt-1 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-800">표준 3분단 균등 (2 - 2 - 2)</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">30석</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">각 분단마다 2열 × 5줄씩 균등 배치</p>
            </div>
          </label>

          <label class="preset-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-slate-300 cursor-pointer transition">
            <input type="radio" name="layout-preset" value="preset-4-equal" class="mt-1 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                <span class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-800">표준 4분단 짝꿍형 (2 - 2 - 2 - 2)</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-2 py-0.5 rounded">32석</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">각 분단마다 2열 × 4줄씩 4개 분단 배치</p>
            </div>
          </label>

          <label class="preset-card flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-slate-300 cursor-pointer transition">
            <input type="radio" name="layout-preset" value="custom" class="mt-1 text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <span class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-800">🛠️ 직접 상세 설정</span>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">분단 수와 각 분단별 가로(열)×세로(줄)를 자유롭게 설정</p>
            </div>
          </label>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Custom Section Builder Area -->
      <div id="custom-builder" class="hidden flex-col gap-3 bg-slate-50 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">
          <span>분단 수 선택:</span>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
            <button type="button" class="btn-sec-count px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded border border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-700" data-count="2">2분단</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-sec-count px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded border border-indigo-600 bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold" data-count="3">3분단</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-sec-count px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded border border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-700" data-count="4">4분단</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-sec-count px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded border border-slate-300 bg-white text-slate-700" data-count="5">5분단</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="custom-sections-list" class="space-y-2">
          <!-- Dynamic custom rows -->
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Capacity Info & Apply Button -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
        <span id="setup-capacity-badge" class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700 bg-indigo-50 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg">
          배치 가능 좌석: 30석
        </span>
        <button id="btn-apply-setup" class="px-5 py-2 text-sm text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 rounded-lg font-bold shadow-md shadow-indigo-200 transition">
          배치표 생성하기 🚀
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Batch Roster Modal -->
  <div id="modal-roster" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 border border-slate-100 flex flex-col gap-4">
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">학생 명단 일괄 입력</h3>
        <button id="btn-close-roster" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 text-xl font-bold p-1">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 rounded-lg p-2.5 text-xs text-indigo-800 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="font-semibold mb-0.5">📌 입력 방법 (엑셀 복사/붙여넣기 가능):</p>
        <p>줄마다 <span class="font-mono bg-white px-1 py-0.5 rounded text-indigo-900 font-bold">학번 이름</span> 순서로 입력하세요. (예: <span class="font-mono">10101 김민준</span> 또는 <span class="font-mono">1번 이서연</span>)</p>
        <p class="text-indigo-600 mt-0.5">* 이름만 입력하셔도 정상 배치됩니다.</p>
      </div>
      <textarea id="roster-textarea" rows="8" class="w-full p-3 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:outline-none resize-none font-mono" placeholder="10101 김민준&#10;10102 이서연&#10;10103 박도윤&#10;..."></textarea>
      <div class="flex justify-end gap-2 pt-2">
        <button id="btn-sample-names" class="px-4 py-2 text-sm text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 hover:bg-indigo-100 rounded-lg font-medium transition">예시 명단 채우기</button>
        <button id="btn-apply-roster" class="px-5 py-2 text-sm text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 rounded-lg font-medium shadow-sm transition">배치표에 적용</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Single Seat Edit Modal -->
  <div id="modal-edit-seat" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl max-w-xs w-full p-5 border border-slate-100 flex flex-col gap-3">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>✏️</span>
        <span id="edit-seat-title">좌석 수정</span>
      </h3>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 mb-1">학번 / 번호</label>
          <input type="text" id="edit-seat-num" class="w-full px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:outline-none" placeholder="예: 10101 또는 1번" maxlength="12">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 mb-1">학생 이름</label>
          <input type="text" id="edit-seat-name" class="w-full px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:outline-none" placeholder="학생 이름 입력" maxlength="10">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100">
        <button id="btn-clear-seat" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-rose-600 bg-rose-50 hover:bg-rose-100 rounded-lg font-medium transition">비우기</button>
        <div class="flex gap-1.5">
          <button id="btn-cancel-edit" class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 rounded-lg font-medium transition">취소</button>
          <button id="btn-save-seat" class="px-4 py-1.5 text-xs text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 rounded-lg font-medium transition">저장</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Custom Alert/Toast Container -->
  <div id="toast" class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 bg-slate-800 text-white px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl shadow-lg text-sm z-50 transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-0 pointer-events-none flex items-center gap-2">
    <span id="toast-icon">✨</span>
    <span id="toast-message">알림</span>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Global active configuration
    let SECTIONS_CONFIG = [
      { id: 1, cols: 3, rows: 4, count: 12, prefix: '1' },
      { id: 2, cols: 2, rows: 3, count: 6, prefix: '2' },
      { id: 3, cols: 3, rows: 4, count: 12, prefix: '3' }
    ];

    // State array: dynamic seat objects with studentId and name
    let seats = [];
    let selectedSeatId = null;
    let editingSeatId = null;
    let isTeacherView = false;
    let totalTargetStudents = 30;

    // Toast helper
    function showToast(message, icon = '💡') {
      const toast = document.getElementById('toast');
      const msg = document.getElementById('toast-message');
      const ico = document.getElementById('toast-icon');
      
      msg.textContent = message;
      ico.textContent = icon;
      toast.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'pointer-events-none');
      toast.classList.add('opacity-100');

      setTimeout(() => {
        toast.classList.remove('opacity-100');
        toast.classList.add('opacity-0', 'pointer-events-none');
      }, 2500);
    }

    // Initialize seats structure according to current SECTIONS_CONFIG
    function initSeats() {
      const preservedData = seats.map(s => ({ studentId: s.studentId, name: s.name })).filter(s => s.name || s.studentId);
      seats = [];
      let globalId = 1;

      SECTIONS_CONFIG.forEach(sec => {
        for (let r = 1; r <= sec.rows; r++) {
          for (let c = 1; c <= sec.cols; c++) {
            seats.push({
              id: globalId,
              section: sec.id,
              row: r,
              col: c,
              label: `${sec.prefix}분단 ${r}-${c}`,
              studentId: '',
              name: ''
            });
            globalId++;
          }
        }
      });

      // Populate with existing or auto student numbering up to totalTargetStudents
      if (preservedData.length > 0) {
        seats.forEach((seat, idx) => {
          if (preservedData[idx]) {
            seat.studentId = preservedData[idx].studentId || '';
            seat.name = preservedData[idx].name || '';
          }
        });
      } else {
        // First initialization: set default student numbers up to totalTargetStudents
        seats.forEach((seat, idx) => {
          if (idx < totalTargetStudents) {
            seat.studentId = `${idx + 1}번`;
            seat.name = '';
          }
        });
      }

      // Update header description
      const descParts = SECTIONS_CONFIG.map(s => `${s.prefix}분단(${s.cols}열×${s.rows}줄)`);
      const totalCapacity = SECTIONS_CONFIG.reduce((acc, cur) => acc + (cur.cols * cur.rows), 0);
      const headerDesc = document.getElementById('header-layout-desc');
      if (headerDesc) {
        headerDesc.textContent = 
          `배치 구조: ${descParts.join(' · ')} [총 ${totalCapacity}석 / 학급 ${totalTargetStudents}명]`;
      }
    }

    // Toggle View Mode UI and indicators
    function updateViewModeUI() {
      const frontInd = document.getElementById('front-indicator');
      const secContainer = document.getElementById('sections-container');
      const viewBadge = document.getElementById('view-status-badge');
      const toggleBtnText = document.getElementById('toggle-view-text');
      const toggleBtnIcon = document.getElementById('toggle-view-icon');
      const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('btn-toggle-view');

      if (!frontInd || !secContainer) return;

      if (isTeacherView) {
        // Teacher View: Blackboard is at the BOTTOM
        frontInd.className = 'w-full mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-col items-center order-3';
        
        // Reorder Sections visually (left to right inverted)
        secContainer.classList.add('flex-row-reverse');

        // Badges & Button updates
        if (toggleBtn) toggleBtn.className = 'px-3.5 py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-lg shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5';
        if (toggleBtnIcon) toggleBtnIcon.textContent = '👨‍🎓';
        if (toggleBtnText) toggleBtnText.textContent = '학생용 시점';
        if (viewBadge) {
          viewBadge.className = 'text-xs bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 border border-purple-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold flex items-center gap-1';
          viewBadge.innerHTML = '<span>👩‍🏫</span><span>교사 시점 (칠판 아래)</span>';
        }
      } else {
        // Student View: Blackboard is at the TOP (Default)
        frontInd.className = 'w-full mb-2.5 sm:mb-3 flex flex-col items-center order-1';

        secContainer.classList.remove('flex-row-reverse');

        if (toggleBtn) toggleBtn.className = 'px-3.5 py-2 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-lg shadow-sm transition flex items-center gap-1.5';
        if (toggleBtnIcon) toggleBtnIcon.textContent = '👩‍🏫';
        if (toggleBtnText) toggleBtnText.textContent = '교사용 시점';
        if (viewBadge) {
          viewBadge.className = 'text-xs bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold flex items-center gap-1';
          viewBadge.innerHTML = '<span>👨‍🎓</span><span>학생 시점 (칠판 위)</span>';
        }
      }
    }

    // Dynamic rendering of all sections & desks
    function renderSeats() {
      updateViewModeUI();

      const secContainer = document.getElementById('sections-container');
      secContainer.innerHTML = '';

      // Find max rows across all sections to balance vertical spacing
      const maxRows = Math.max(...SECTIONS_CONFIG.map(s => s.rows));

      SECTIONS_CONFIG.forEach((sec, sIdx) => {
        // 1. Create section wrapper
        const secWrapper = document.createElement('div');
        secWrapper.className = `flex-[${sec.cols}] min-w-0 bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-2.5 sm:p-3.5 flex flex-col items-center shadow-sm`;

        // Section header badge
        const headerColors = ['text-blue-700', 'text-emerald-700', 'text-indigo-700', 'text-violet-700', 'text-rose-700', 'text-amber-700', 'text-teal-700'];
        const dotColors = ['bg-blue-500', 'bg-emerald-500', 'bg-indigo-500', 'bg-violet-500', 'bg-rose-500', 'bg-amber-500', 'bg-teal-500'];
        const colorIdx = sIdx % headerColors.length;

        secWrapper.innerHTML = `
          <div class="text-xs font-bold ${headerColors[colorIdx]} uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${dotColors[colorIdx]}"></span>
            <span>${sec.prefix}분단 (${sec.cols}열 × ${sec.rows}줄)</span>
          </div>
        `;

        // Missing rows spacer if in teacher view (when this section has fewer rows than max)
        const rowDiff = maxRows - sec.rows;
        if (isTeacherView && rowDiff > 0) {
          const topSpacer = document.createElement('div');
          topSpacer.className = 'w-full mb-2 sm:mb-2.5 py-3 sm:py-4 border border-dashed border-slate-200/80 rounded-xl bg-white/40';
          secWrapper.appendChild(topSpacer);
        }

        // Section Grid container
        const gridEl = document.createElement('div');
        gridEl.className = 'grid gap-1.5 sm:gap-2.5 w-full';
        gridEl.style.gridTemplateColumns = `repeat(${sec.cols}, minmax(0, 1fr))`;

        // Ordering for teacher view vs student view
        const rowList = [];
        if (isTeacherView) {
          for (let r = sec.rows; r >= 1; r--) rowList.push(r);
        } else {
          for (let r = 1; r <= sec.rows; r++) rowList.push(r);
        }

        const colList = [];
        if (isTeacherView) {
          for (let c = sec.cols; c >= 1; c--) colList.push(c);
        } else {
          for (let c = 1; c <= sec.cols; c++) colList.push(c);
        }

        rowList.forEach(r => {
          colList.forEach(c => {
            const seat = seats.find(s => s.section === sec.id && s.row === r && s.col === c);
            if (!seat) return;

            const card = document.createElement('div');
            const isSelected = selectedSeatId === seat.id;
            const hasName = Boolean(seat.name && seat.name.trim());
            const hasStudentId = Boolean(seat.studentId && seat.studentId.trim());
            const hasStudent = hasName || hasStudentId;

            card.className = `seat-card relative rounded-xl border-2 p-1.5 sm:p-2.5 flex flex-col justify-between items-center cursor-pointer select-none min-h-[76px] sm:min-h-[86px] lg:min-h-[92px] transition-all ${
              isSelected 
                ? 'ring-2 ring-indigo-500 bg-indigo-50 border-indigo-400 scale-[1.02] shadow-md z-10' 
                : hasStudent
                  ? 'bg-white border-slate-300 hover:border-indigo-400 shadow-sm hover:shadow'
                  : 'bg-slate-100/60 border-dashed border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-200/60 text-slate-400'
            }`;

            card.innerHTML = `
              <div class="w-full flex justify-between items-center text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono leading-none">
                <span>${seat.row}-${seat.col}</span>
                <span class="w-4 h-4 sm:w-4.5 sm:h-4.5 rounded-full bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500">${seat.id}</span>
              </div>
              
              <div class="my-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full px-0.5 leading-tight text-center py-1">
                ${hasStudentId 
                  ? `<span class="student-id-txt text-[11px] sm:text-xs lg:text-sm font-extrabold text-indigo-700 truncate w-full tracking-tight mb-0.5">${seat.studentId}</span>`
                  : ''
                }
                <span class="student-name-txt font-black text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg truncate w-full tracking-tight ${hasName ? 'text-slate-900' : 'text-slate-300 font-normal'}">
                  ${hasName ? seat.name : (hasStudentId ? '' : '빈자리')}
                </span>
              </div>
            `;

            card.addEventListener('click', (e) => handleSeatClick(seat.id, e));
            card.addEventListener('dblclick', (e) => {
              e.stopPropagation();
              openSeatEditModal(seat.id);
            });

            gridEl.appendChild(card);
          });
        });

        secWrapper.appendChild(gridEl);

        // Missing rows spacer in student view (at bottom)
        if (!isTeacherView && rowDiff > 0) {
          const bottomSpacer = document.createElement('div');
          bottomSpacer.className = 'w-full mt-2 sm:mt-2.5 py-3 sm:py-4 border border-dashed border-slate-200/80 rounded-xl bg-white/40';
          secWrapper.appendChild(bottomSpacer);
        }

        secContainer.appendChild(secWrapper);

        // 2. Add aisle between sections (if not last)
        if (sIdx < SECTIONS_CONFIG.length - 1) {
          const aisle = document.createElement('div');
          aisle.className = 'self-stretch flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-slate-300 text-[11px] font-semibold select-none px-0.5 sm:px-1';
          aisle.innerHTML = `
            <div class="h-full border-l-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center relative">
              <span class="bg-white px-1 py-3 text-slate-400 text-[10px] tracking-widest writing-vertical rounded [writing-mode:vertical-rl]">
                통로
              </span>
            </div>
          `;
          secContainer.appendChild(aisle);
        }
      });

      // Update badge
      const occupiedCount = seats.filter(s => (s.name && s.name.trim()) || (s.studentId && s.studentId.trim())).length;
      document.getElementById('seat-count-badge').textContent = `배치 현황: ${occupiedCount} / ${seats.length}석 (학생 ${totalTargetStudents}명)`;
    }

    // Toggle teacher / student view listener
    const toggleBtn = document.getElementById('btn-toggle-view');
    if (toggleBtn) {
      toggleBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        isTeacherView = !isTeacherView;
        selectedSeatId = null;
        renderSeats();
        showToast(
          isTeacherView 
            ? '교사용 시점으로 전환되었습니다 (칠판이 아래에 위치).' 
            : '학생용 시점으로 전환되었습니다 (칠판이 위에 위치).',
          isTeacherView ? '👩‍🏫' : '👨‍🎓'
        );
      });
    }

    function handleSeatClick(seatId, event) {
      if (selectedSeatId === null) {
        selectedSeatId = seatId;
        renderSeats();
        showToast(`좌석 #${seatId} 선택됨. 교환할 다른 좌석을 누르거나 더블클릭하여 수정하세요.`, '👉');
      } else if (selectedSeatId === seatId) {
        openSeatEditModal(seatId);
        selectedSeatId = null;
        renderSeats();
      } else {
        const seatA = seats.find(s => s.id === selectedSeatId);
        const seatB = seats.find(s => s.id === seatId);

        if (seatA && seatB) {
          const tempName = seatA.name;
          const tempId = seatA.studentId;

          seatA.name = seatB.name;
          seatA.studentId = seatB.studentId;

          seatB.name = tempName;
          seatB.studentId = tempId;

          showToast(`[${seatA.label}]과 [${seatB.label}]의 자리를 교환했습니다.`, '🔄');
        }

        selectedSeatId = null;
        renderSeats();
      }
    }

    function openSeatEditModal(seatId) {
      editingSeatId = seatId;
      const seat = seats.find(s => s.id === seatId);
      if (!seat) return;

      document.getElementById('edit-seat-title').textContent = `${seat.label} (번호 ${seat.id})`;
      const numInput = document.getElementById('edit-seat-num');
      const nameInput = document.getElementById('edit-seat-name');

      numInput.value = seat.studentId || '';
      nameInput.value = seat.name || '';

      document.getElementById('modal-edit-seat').classList.remove('hidden');
      setTimeout(() => numInput.focus(), 50);
    }

    function closeSeatEditModal() {
      editingSeatId = null;
      document.getElementById('modal-edit-seat').classList.add('hidden');
    }

    // Save individual seat
    document.getElementById('btn-save-seat').addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (editingSeatId !== null) {
        const numVal = document.getElementById('edit-seat-num').value.trim();
        const nameVal = document.getElementById('edit-seat-name').value.trim();
        const seat = seats.find(s => s.id === editingSeatId);
        if (seat) {
          seat.studentId = numVal;
          seat.name = nameVal;
        }
        closeSeatEditModal();
        renderSeats();
        showToast('좌석 정보가 저장되었습니다.', '✅');
      }
    });

    // Clear individual seat
    document.getElementById('btn-clear-seat').addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (editingSeatId !== null) {
        const seat = seats.find(s => s.id === editingSeatId);
        if (seat) {
          seat.studentId = '';
          seat.name = '';
        }
        closeSeatEditModal();
        renderSeats();
        showToast('좌석을 비웠습니다.', '🗑️');
      }
    });

    document.getElementById('btn-cancel-edit').addEventListener('click', closeSeatEditModal);

    // Setup Modal Logic
    const modalSetup = document.getElementById('modal-setup');
    const btnOpenSetup = document.getElementById('btn-open-setup');
    const btnCloseSetup = document.getElementById('btn-close-setup');
    const btnApplySetup = document.getElementById('btn-apply-setup');
    const customBuilder = document.getElementById('custom-builder');
    const customSectionsList = document.getElementById('custom-sections-list');
    const totalStudentsInput = document.getElementById('setup-total-students');
    const setupCapacityBadge = document.getElementById('setup-capacity-badge');
    let customSectionCount = 3;

    // Open setup modal anytime
    if (btnOpenSetup && modalSetup) {
      btnOpenSetup.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (btnCloseSetup) btnCloseSetup.classList.remove('hidden');
        modalSetup.classList.remove('hidden');
      });
    }

    if (btnCloseSetup && modalSetup) {
      btnCloseSetup.addEventListener('click', () => {
        modalSetup.classList.add('hidden');
      });
    }

    // Handle Preset selection styling and custom toggle
    document.querySelectorAll('input[name="layout-preset"]').forEach(radio => {
      radio.addEventListener('change', (e) => {
        document.querySelectorAll('.preset-card').forEach(card => {
          card.classList.remove('border-indigo-600', 'bg-indigo-50/50');
          card.classList.add('border-slate-200', 'bg-white');
        });
        const currentCard = e.target.closest('.preset-card');
        if (currentCard) {
          currentCard.classList.add('border-indigo-600', 'bg-indigo-50/50');
          currentCard.classList.remove('border-slate-200', 'bg-white');
        }

        // Toggle custom builder when 'custom' is selected
        if (e.target.value === 'custom') {
          if (customBuilder) {
            customBuilder.classList.remove('hidden');
            customBuilder.classList.add('flex');
          }
          renderCustomInputs();
        } else {
          if (customBuilder) {
            customBuilder.classList.add('hidden');
            customBuilder.classList.remove('flex');
          }
        }
        updateSetupCapacityDisplay();
      });
    });

    // Custom section count buttons (2, 3, 4, 5)
    document.querySelectorAll('.btn-sec-count').forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        document.querySelectorAll('.btn-sec-count').forEach(b => {
          b.classList.remove('bg-indigo-600', 'border-indigo-600', 'text-white');
          b.classList.add('bg-white', 'border-slate-300', 'text-slate-700');
        });
        e.target.classList.add('bg-indigo-600', 'border-indigo-600', 'text-white');
        e.target.classList.remove('bg-white', 'border-slate-300', 'text-slate-700');
        customSectionCount = parseInt(e.target.dataset.count, 10);
        renderCustomInputs();
      });
    });

    function renderCustomInputs() {
      customSectionsList.innerHTML = '';
      for (let i = 1; i <= customSectionCount; i++) {
        const row = document.createElement('div');
        row.className = 'flex items-center justify-between bg-white p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-xs';
        
        // Sensible default values based on section count
        let defaultCols = 2;
        let defaultRows = 4;
        if (customSectionCount === 3) {
          defaultCols = (i === 2) ? 2 : 3;
          defaultRows = (i === 2) ? 3 : 4;
        } else if (customSectionCount === 5) {
          defaultCols = (i % 2 === 0) ? 1 : 2;
          defaultRows = 3;
        }

        row.innerHTML = `
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-700">${i}분단</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <label class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <span class="text-slate-500">가로:</span>
              <input type="number" min="1" max="5" value="${defaultCols}" class="custom-col-input w-12 px-1.5 py-1 border rounded text-center font-semibold" data-sec="${i}">
              <span class="text-slate-500">열</span>
            </label>
            <span class="text-slate-300">×</span>
            <label class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <span class="text-slate-500">세로:</span>
              <input type="number" min="1" max="8" value="${defaultRows}" class="custom-row-input w-12 px-1.5 py-1 border rounded text-center font-semibold" data-sec="${i}">
              <span class="text-slate-500">줄</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        `;
        customSectionsList.appendChild(row);
      }
      customSectionsList.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(input => {
        input.addEventListener('input', updateSetupCapacityDisplay);
      });
      updateSetupCapacityDisplay();
    }

    function calculateSelectedCapacity() {
      const selectedPreset = document.querySelector('input[name="layout-preset"]:checked').value;
      if (selectedPreset === 'preset-3-2-3') return 30;
      if (selectedPreset === 'preset-3-equal') return 30;
      if (selectedPreset === 'preset-4-equal') return 32;
      if (selectedPreset === 'custom') {
        let total = 0;
        const colInputs = customSectionsList.querySelectorAll('.custom-col-input');
        const rowInputs = customSectionsList.querySelectorAll('.custom-row-input');
        colInputs.forEach((cIn, idx) => {
          const cols = parseInt(cIn.value, 10) || 1;
          const rows = parseInt(rowInputs[idx].value, 10) || 1;
          total += (cols * rows);
        });
        return total;
      }
      return 30;
    }

    function updateSetupCapacityDisplay() {
      const cap = calculateSelectedCapacity();
      setupCapacityBadge.textContent = `배치 가능 좌석: ${cap}석`;
    }

    // Apply configuration from modal
    btnApplySetup.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const selectedPreset = document.querySelector('input[name="layout-preset"]:checked').value;
      const countVal = parseInt(totalStudentsInput.value, 10);
      totalTargetStudents = (isNaN(countVal) || countVal < 1) ? 30 : countVal;

      if (selectedPreset === 'preset-3-2-3') {
        SECTIONS_CONFIG = [
          { id: 1, cols: 3, rows: 4, count: 12, prefix: '1' },
          { id: 2, cols: 2, rows: 3, count: 6, prefix: '2' },
          { id: 3, cols: 3, rows: 4, count: 12, prefix: '3' }
        ];
      } else if (selectedPreset === 'preset-3-equal') {
        SECTIONS_CONFIG = [
          { id: 1, cols: 2, rows: 5, count: 10, prefix: '1' },
          { id: 2, cols: 2, rows: 5, count: 10, prefix: '2' },
          { id: 3, cols: 2, rows: 5, count: 10, prefix: '3' }
        ];
      } else if (selectedPreset === 'preset-4-equal') {
        SECTIONS_CONFIG = [
          { id: 1, cols: 2, rows: 4, count: 8, prefix: '1' },
          { id: 2, cols: 2, rows: 4, count: 8, prefix: '2' },
          { id: 3, cols: 2, rows: 4, count: 8, prefix: '3' },
          { id: 4, cols: 2, rows: 4, count: 8, prefix: '4' }
        ];
      } else if (selectedPreset === 'custom') {
        const colInputs = customSectionsList.querySelectorAll('.custom-col-input');
        const rowInputs = customSectionsList.querySelectorAll('.custom-row-input');
        SECTIONS_CONFIG = [];
        colInputs.forEach((cIn, idx) => {
          const cols = Math.max(1, parseInt(cIn.value, 10) || 1);
          const rows = Math.max(1, parseInt(rowInputs[idx].value, 10) || 1);
          SECTIONS_CONFIG.push({
            id: idx + 1,
            cols: cols,
            rows: rows,
            count: cols * rows,
            prefix: String(idx + 1)
          });
        });
      }

      modalSetup.classList.add('hidden');
      selectedSeatId = null;
      initSeats();
      renderSeats();
      showToast(`총 ${totalTargetStudents}명 맞춤 배치표가 생성되었습니다!`, '🚀');
    });

    // Shuffle logic (Fisher-Yates)
    document.getElementById('btn-shuffle').addEventListener('click', () => {
      const activePairs = seats
        .map(s => ({ studentId: s.studentId, name: s.name }))
        .filter(p => (p.name && p.name.trim()) || (p.studentId && p.studentId.trim()));

      if (activePairs.length === 0) {
        showToast('배치할 학생 데이터가 없습니다. [명단 일괄 입력]을 먼저 진행해주세요.', '⚠️');
        return;
      }

      for (let i = activePairs.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {
        const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));
        [activePairs[i], activePairs[j]] = [activePairs[j], activePairs[i]];
      }

      seats.forEach((seat, idx) => {
        if (activePairs[idx]) {
          seat.studentId = activePairs[idx].studentId || '';
          seat.name = activePairs[idx].name || '';
        } else {
          seat.studentId = '';
          seat.name = '';
        }
      });

      selectedSeatId = null;
      renderSeats();
      showToast('좌석이 무작위로 재배치되었습니다!', '🎲');
    });

    // Reset all seats
    document.getElementById('btn-reset').addEventListener('click', () => {
      seats.forEach((seat, idx) => {
        seat.studentId = (idx < totalTargetStudents) ? `${idx + 1}번` : '';
        seat.name = '';
      });
      selectedSeatId = null;
      renderSeats();
      showToast('모든 좌석이 초기화되었습니다.', '🔄');
    });

    // Batch roster modal handlers
    const modalRoster = document.getElementById('modal-roster');
    const rosterTextarea = document.getElementById('roster-textarea');

    document.getElementById('btn-open-list').addEventListener('click', () => {
      const currentList = seats
        .filter(s => s.name || s.studentId)
        .map(s => s.studentId ? `${s.studentId} ${s.name}`.trim() : s.name.trim());
      rosterTextarea.value = currentList.join('\n');
      modalRoster.classList.remove('hidden');
    });

    document.getElementById('btn-close-roster').addEventListener('click', () => {
      modalRoster.classList.add('hidden');
    });

    function parseRosterLine(line) {
      const trimmed = line.trim();
      if (!trimmed) return null;

      const parts = trimmed.split(/[\t, ]+/);
      if (parts.length >= 2) {
        return {
          studentId: parts[0],
          name: parts.slice(1).join(' ')
        };
      } else {
        return {
          studentId: '',
          name: trimmed
        };
      }
    }

    document.getElementById('btn-apply-roster').addEventListener('click', () => {
      const text = rosterTextarea.value;
      const lines = text.split('\n').map(l => parseRosterLine(l)).filter(Boolean);

      if (lines.length > seats.length) {
        showToast(`정원(${seats.length}석)을 초과한 ${lines.length - seats.length}명은 제외됩니다.`, '⚠️');
      }

      seats.forEach((seat, idx) => {
        if (lines[idx]) {
          seat.studentId = lines[idx].studentId || '';
          seat.name = lines[idx].name || '';
        } else {
          seat.studentId = '';
          seat.name = '';
        }
      });

      modalRoster.classList.add('hidden');
      selectedSeatId = null;
      renderSeats();
      showToast(`${Math.min(lines.length, seats.length)}명의 학생이 배치되었습니다.`, '🎉');
    });

    // Sample data loader
    document.getElementById('btn-sample-names').addEventListener('click', () => {
      const samples = [
        "10101 김민준", "10102 이서연", "10103 박도윤", "10104 정하은", "10105 최지우",
        "10106 강서준", "10107 조수아", "10108 윤예준", "10109 장민서", "10110 임시우",
        "10111 한채원", "10112 오은우", "10113 서지원", "10114 신유찬", "10115 권다은",
        "10116 황선우", "10117 송지아", "10118 안로운", "10119 류서현", "10120 홍준혁",
        "10121 고유나", "10122 문도현", "10123 양시은", "10124 손태민", "10125 배수빈",
        "10126 백지호", "10127 허윤아", "10128 노준우", "10129 유시아", "10130 심민건"
      ];
      rosterTextarea.value = samples.slice(0, seats.length).join('\n');
    });

    // Print Handlers
    function executePrint() {
      try {
        window.print();
      } catch (err) {
        console.warn('Direct print blocked:', err);
        openPrintWindow();
      }
    }

    function openPrintWindow() {
      const classTitle = document.getElementById('class-title-input')?.value || '우리 반 좌석 배치표';
      const printContent = document.querySelector('.print-area').outerHTML;
      const printWindow = window.open('', '_blank', 'width=1100,height=800');
      if (!printWindow) {
        showToast('팝업 차단을 해제하거나 Ctrl + P 단축키를 눌러주세요.', '⚠️');
        return;
      }

      printWindow.document.write(`
        <!DOCTYPE html>
        <html lang="ko">
        <head>
          <meta charset="UTF-8">
          <title>${classTitle} - 인쇄</title>
          <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"><\/script>
          <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pretendard:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
          <style>
            @page { 
              size: A4 landscape; 
              margin: 4mm 6mm; 
            }
            *, *::before, *::after {
              box-sizing: border-box !important;
            }
            html, body { 
              font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; 
              background: #fff; 
              padding: 0; 
              margin: 0; 
              height: 100% !important;
              max-height: 100% !important;
              overflow: hidden !important;
              -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; 
              print-color-adjust: exact; 
            }
            .print-area {
              width: 100% !important;
              max-width: 100% !important;
              height: 98vh !important;
              max-height: 98vh !important;
              padding: 1mm 2mm !important;
              margin: 0 auto !important;
              display: flex !important;
              flex-direction: column !important;
              justify-content: flex-start !important;
              align-items: center !important;
              gap: 3px !important;
              border: none !important;
              box-shadow: none !important;
              page-break-inside: avoid !important;
              break-inside: avoid !important;
              overflow: hidden !important;
            }
            .no-print {
              display: none !important;
            }
            #class-title-input {
              border: none !important;
              background: transparent !important;
              font-size: 22px !important;
              font-weight: 900 !important;
              text-align: center !important;
              width: 100% !important;
              margin-bottom: 0px !important;
              color: #0f172a !important;
            }
            .creator-tag {
              font-size: 10px !important;
              color: #64748b !important;
              font-weight: 600 !important;
            }
            #front-indicator {
              margin-bottom: 4px !important;
              margin-top: 0 !important;
              width: 100% !important;
            }
            #front-indicator > div {
              padding-top: 3px !important;
              padding-bottom: 3px !important;
            }
            .print-area > .overflow-x-auto {
              flex: 1 1 0% !important;
              width: 100% !important;
              display: flex !important;
              flex-direction: column !important;
              min-height: 0 !important;
              overflow: hidden !important;
              padding-bottom: 0 !important;
            }
            #sections-container {
              flex: 1 1 0% !important;
              height: 100% !important;
              min-height: 0 !important;
              width: 100% !important;
              min-width: 100% !important;
              gap: 8px !important;
              align-items: stretch !important;
            }
            #sections-container > div {
              height: 100% !important;
              display: flex !important;
              flex-direction: column !important;
              padding: 4px 6px !important;
            }
            #sections-container > div > .grid {
              flex: 1 1 0% !important;
              height: 100% !important;
              min-height: 0 !important;
              gap: 4px !important;
            }
            .seat-card {
              border: 1.5px solid #334155 !important;
              min-height: 0 !important;
              height: 100% !important;
              padding: 2px 3px !important;
              display: flex !important;
              flex-direction: column !important;
              justify-content: space-between !important;
              overflow: hidden !important;
            }
            .student-id-txt {
              font-size: clamp(10px, 1.3vw, 13px) !important;
              font-weight: 800 !important;
              color: #312e81 !important;
              margin-bottom: 1px !important;
              line-height: 1.1 !important;
            }
            .student-name-txt {
              font-size: clamp(14px, 2.1vw, 21px) !important;
              font-weight: 900 !important;
              color: #000000 !important;
              letter-spacing: 0.3px !important;
              line-height: 1.1 !important;
              white-space: nowrap !important;
            }
          </style>
        </head>
        <body class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
          ${printContent}
          <script>
            const inputEl = document.getElementById('class-title-input');
            if (inputEl) inputEl.value = "${classTitle.replace(/"/g, '\\"')}";
            window.onload = function() {
              window.print();
            };
          <\/script>
        </body>
        </html>
      `);
      printWindow.document.close();
    }

    document.getElementById('btn-print').addEventListener('click', executePrint);
    document.getElementById('btn-print-popup').addEventListener('click', openPrintWindow);

    // Keyboard shortcuts
    window.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      if (e.key === 'Escape') {
        closeSeatEditModal();
        modalRoster.classList.add('hidden');
        if (modalAi) modalAi.classList.add('hidden');
        if (modalSetup && btnCloseSetup && !btnCloseSetup.classList.contains('hidden')) {
          modalSetup.classList.add('hidden');
        }
        if (selectedSeatId) {
          selectedSeatId = null;
          renderSeats();
        }
      }
    });

    // Initialize application on load (Prompt Initial Setup Modal)
    window.onload = function() {
      initSeats();
      renderSeats();
      // Setup modal is visible on initial load for the user to choose
      if (modalSetup) {
        modalSetup.classList.remove('hidden');
      }
    };
  </script>
</body>
</html>
